# macOS shadcn components

Controls should read as current macOS (Tahoe / Liquid Glass) — context decides fill.

## Inputs / selects / textarea

| Class | When | Look |
|-------|------|------|
| `.macos-input` / `.macos-select` (defaults) | Forms everywhere (Request, etc.) | Light fill + `1px` border + ~8px radius; accent focus ring |
| `.macos-input-plain` / `.macos-select-plain` | Settings row values | Transparent, text + chevrons only |
| `.macos-search` | Finder / Settings sidebar | Capsule fill, no hard border |
| `.macos-button-primary` (Button default) | Primary actions | `var(--macos-accent)` fill, white label |

- Focus on boxed fields: accent ring via `color-mix(... var(--macos-accent) ...)`
- Never hardcode `#007aff` — use `var(--macos-accent)`

## Switch & radio

- Switch: accent on, flat `#e5e5ea` off, white thumb
- Radio: flat grey off; accent + white center dot on

## Floating chrome (Tahoe)

- Toolbar actions: `FloatingGroup` / `FloatingGroupButton` (icons must stay readable in dark — use `.macos-floating-btn` colours)
- Apps with a left nav (Settings, Finder): `FloatingSidebarShell` + `FloatingSidebar` + `FloatingSidebarContent`
- Both sidebar and content float: full `rounded-[16px]` on all corners, shell padding on every side, gap between panes
